# Taking the dagger in the armoury of the palace (map 40): the guard calls
# the sorcerer, who appears beside the Avatar. Arriving he sets off to his
# post; the script that brought him ends that walk at once, as it has
# already begun in the original. He stays and deals with the thief there
# (he used to walk off and cast his spell from another room).
args: --map 40 --pos 12087,10139,48
do: t3;pickup:18622;t250;where:32
expect: where 32: 12031,9983,48
expect: bark by 32: What seems to be the problem?
